{
  "script_id": "solid-angle",
  "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
  "voice_key": "yunxi",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.24,
      "size": 51840,
      "text": "平面上量角度用弧度：把角放在单位圆心，量它截下的弧长。整整一圈是二倍圆周率。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.59,
      "size": 57456,
      "text": "空间里怎么量？把角放在单位球心，量它截下的球面面积。这个量叫立体角，单位是球面度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.3,
      "size": 52848,
      "text": "整个空间是多少？单位球总面积四倍圆周率，所以全空间立体角就是四倍圆周率球面度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "triple",
      "line_id": "tp-1",
      "filename": "triple-tp-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/triple-tp-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.23,
      "size": 51696,
      "text": "三条射线张成的立体角有个漂亮公式，叫范奥斯特罗姆-斯特拉基公式。半角的正切等于一个分式。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "triple",
      "line_id": "tp-2",
      "filename": "triple-tp-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/triple-tp-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.97,
      "size": 47520,
      "text": "分子正是三重积的绝对值，也就是三阶行列式。这与算四面体体积用的是同一个量。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "triple",
      "line_id": "tp-3",
      "filename": "triple-tp-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/triple-tp-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.73,
      "size": 59760,
      "text": "三条正交射线代进去，算出圆周率的一半，正好是全空间的八分之一。屏幕上的占比读数显示百分之十二点五。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "excess",
      "line_id": "ex-1",
      "filename": "excess-ex-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/excess-ex-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.77,
      "size": 60336,
      "text": "还有一条完全不同的算法。三条射线在单位球上截出一个球面三角形，而立体角就是这个三角形的面积。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "excess",
      "line_id": "ex-2",
      "filename": "excess-ex-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/excess-ex-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.42,
      "size": 54720,
      "text": "球面三角形面积等于内角和减圆周率，这是吉拉尔定理。于是量出三个球面角就能算立体角。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "excess",
      "line_id": "ex-3",
      "filename": "excess-ex-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/excess-ex-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.66,
      "size": 58608,
      "text": "两条路必须给出同一个数。屏幕上的残差读数验证了这点，四十组随机射线的偏差都在十的负八次方以内。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "cone",
      "line_id": "cn-1",
      "filename": "cone-cn-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/cone-cn-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.56,
      "size": 56880,
      "text": "最简单的立体角来自圆锥。半顶角为阿尔法的圆锥，立体角等于二倍圆周率乘上一减阿尔法的余弦。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "cone",
      "line_id": "cn-2",
      "filename": "cone-cn-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/cone-cn-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.7,
      "size": 59184,
      "text": "代入检验：半顶角九十度时得二倍圆周率，正是半空间；一百八十度时得四倍圆周率，正是全空间。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "cone",
      "line_id": "cn-3",
      "filename": "cone-cn-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/cone-cn-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.39,
      "size": 54288,
      "text": "请打开圆锥对照。紫色虚线画的圆锥与黄色球面三角形立体角相同，虽然形状完全不一样。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "vertex",
      "line_id": "vt-1",
      "filename": "vertex-vt-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/vertex-vt-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.42,
      "size": 54720,
      "text": "多面体每个顶点都张出一个立体角。立方体的顶点是三条正交棱，立体角恰好是圆周率的一半。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "vertex",
      "line_id": "vt-2",
      "filename": "vertex-vt-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/vertex-vt-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.13,
      "size": 50112,
      "text": "八个顶点加起来正好四倍圆周率，等于全空间。这看起来像条定律，其实只是巧合。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "vertex",
      "line_id": "vt-3",
      "filename": "vertex-vt-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/vertex-vt-3.mp3",
      "duration": 4.8,
      "size": 76752,
      "text": "正四面体每个顶点的立体角约零点五五，四个加起来只有二点二，远不到四倍圆周率。注意这与角亏总和恒为四倍圆周率是两件不同的事。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.75,
      "size": 43920,
      "text": "第一，立体角等于球面面积除以半径平方，全空间是四倍圆周率球面度。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 2.53,
      "size": 40464,
      "text": "第二，三重积公式与球面盈余两条路给出同一个数，可以互相验证。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "solid-angle",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/solid-angle/yunxi/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.79,
      "size": 60624,
      "text": "第三，立方体八顶点之和恰为四倍圆周率只是巧合，正四面体就不成立。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
